      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. for the lesson plan, i want to make sure the students see the full picture though. how should i present the arguments from people who say these wealth gaps are more about individual choices or economic factors rather than systemic issues? i don't want the students to think there isn't a debate about this.",
